  "verse_id": "tsa-a10-v18",
  "song": "tsa-a10",
  "verse": 18,
  "quick_english": "Going-with-the-knowable-part — by gross-subtle-other-nature triply: the world-tattva-kalā-path-distinction is triply named by mātṛ-viśrānti; likewise triply: in its being-authority, the padā-dhvā; in the authority's agitation-wave-subsiding, the mantra-dhvā; in its subsiding, the full-knowership, the varṇa-dhvā — it, and this, in such viśrānti, becomes one whose own-nature is gained: thus the one's sixfoldness is warranted.",
